                        ],
                        "form": "tranquilizing"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "19643fb9-b265-44cc-b83c-0e2d3d92c6a1",
                        "entry_id": "01baab2b-6c40-3de4-98b5-cd624771528b",
                        "tags": [
                            "participle",
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "tranquilized"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "9597b948-46c9-4cf8-8cec-d42d725f0999",
                        "entry_id": "01baab2b-6c40-3de4-98b5-cd624771528b",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "tranquilized"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f643dfe6-487f-38ec-9194-8684853818ea",
                        "entry_id": "01baab2b-6c40-3de4-98b5-cd624771528b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To calm (a person or animal) or put them to sleep using a tranquilizer dart."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9900c261-f0ca-4d49-8760-491eb76c408f",
                                "sense_id": "f643dfe6-487f-38ec-9194-8684853818ea",
                                "text": "The escaped lion was finally tracked down, tranquilized, and safely returned to the zoo."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "277146d0-3da3-435e-be86-d11e4a92c6ba",
                                "sense_id": "f643dfe6-487f-38ec-9194-8684853818ea",
                                "text": "Miss Ratched shall line us all against the wall, where we’ll face the terrible maw of a muzzle-loading shotgun which she has loaded with Miltowns! Thorazines! Libriums! Stelazines! And with a wave of her sword, blooie! Tranquilize all of us completely out of existence."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "90c0565f-a900-4d04-9b94-bbcfb8c1f267",
                                "sense_id": "f643dfe6-487f-38ec-9194-8684853818ea",
                                "text": "When the public protests, confronted with some obvious evidence of damaging results of pesticide applications, it is fed little tranquilizing pills of half truth."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8d8211e2-4254-3ec4-85c2-2ee2cc22ae2a",
                        "entry_id": "01baab2b-6c40-3de4-98b5-cd624771528b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To make (something or someone) tranquil."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "literary",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5205af54-ae9d-4858-ac3b-c2ad9591327f",
                                "sense_id": "8d8211e2-4254-3ec4-85c2-2ee2cc22ae2a",
                                "text": "1779, Frances Burney, Evelina, Dublin: Price, Corcoran et al., Volume 2, Letter 14, p. 87,\n[…] with words of sweetest kindness and consolation, he soothed and tranquilised me."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5f6e0ba1-c413-40a4-8253-df3122e9b255",
                                "sense_id": "8d8211e2-4254-3ec4-85c2-2ee2cc22ae2a",
                                "text": "[…] I feel my heart glow with an enthusiasm which elevates me to heaven, for nothing contributes so much to tranquillize the mind as a steady purpose,—a point on which the soul may fix its intellectual eye."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "147d8be1-d4f6-4084-82e3-c445298d6442",
                                "sense_id": "8d8211e2-4254-3ec4-85c2-2ee2cc22ae2a",
                                "text": "This threat, the reader may well suppose, was not very tranquilizing to my feelings."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f517dbf3-dff3-4aa7-95bb-50cbb19b7cf0",
                                "sense_id": "8d8211e2-4254-3ec4-85c2-2ee2cc22ae2a",
                                "text": "The column was placed under the orders of Major Renaud, who pushed up the road; fighting as occasion offered; tranquillizing the country by the very simple expedient of hanging everybody who showed signs of insubordination […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "90afce8d-50e0-4733-a4de-cda42957bdbe",
                                "sense_id": "8d8211e2-4254-3ec4-85c2-2ee2cc22ae2a",
                                "text": "Supported by an impregnable sense of justice but still dangerously fuming, Lucia went back to her garden-room, to tranquillize herself with an hour’s practice on the new piano."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d5392e2-5e4b-40b1-8a91-b1414a9910c4",
                                "sense_id": "8d8211e2-4254-3ec4-85c2-2ee2cc22ae2a",
                                "text": "But time had tranquillized Dina’s worries about the landlord."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b4d2e8d2-2a3b-3326-ba8d-841ad365bf3f",
                        "entry_id": "01baab2b-6c40-3de4-98b5-cd624771528b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To become tranquil."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive",
                            "obsolete",
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e94c3a31-8f89-4422-a7f5-548a0140b7af",
                                "sense_id": "b4d2e8d2-2a3b-3326-ba8d-841ad365bf3f",
                                "text": "Seest thou not, that this unseasonable gravity is admitted to quell the palpitations of this unmanageable heart? But still it will go on with its boundings. I’ll try, as I ride in my chariot, to tranquillize."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2ebc111a-fe34-3319-bd89-d42db4d21d5e",
                        "entry_id": "01baab2b-6c40-3de4-98b5-cd624771528b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To dart (a person or animal) with a sedative"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b077b22d-531c-4029-be74-6ca19544aca4",
                                "sense_id": "2ebc111a-fe34-3319-bd89-d42db4d21d5e",
                                "text": "The bear should go down several minutes after being tranquilized."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "282c0612-14b6-442f-a210-1354f3d2ceb4",
                                "sense_id": "2ebc111a-fe34-3319-bd89-d42db4d21d5e",
                                "text": "Moose should only be down about 15 to 20 minutes after being tranquilized."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "30ed0449-5dd6-4538-a986-3b67f482f36d",
                        "source_entry_id": "01baab2b-6c40-3de4-98b5-cd624771528b",
                        "source_sense_description": "to use a drug to sedate a person or animal",
                        "target_lang_word": "verdoven",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "verdoven",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7f2ea18b-2157-3d7a-8a2c-37cab2f6bae1",
                                        "entry_id": "a2e63d0b-5b68-3fcc-948c-18c4aa100120",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "de pijnprikkel onderdrukken, bijvoorbeeld door het toedienen van een medicijn"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5cb01cc-5a5e-4c9d-b093-4ebafd92a7a1",
                                                "sense_id": "7f2ea18b-2157-3d7a-8a2c-37cab2f6bae1",
                                                "text": "Hij verdoofde de huid plaatselijk voordat hij aan de kleine ingreep begon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39172ad8-c914-4068-9182-b4e803932cb5",
                                                "sense_id": "7f2ea18b-2157-3d7a-8a2c-37cab2f6bae1",
                                                "text": "Als toetje nam ik twee ibuprofen-pillen om de pijn in mijn voeten te verdoven en ik kroop met vermoeide benen in mijn slaapzak."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3c806969-de19-41d8-80be-02d35b2aa21a",
                        "source_entry_id": "01baab2b-6c40-3de4-98b5-cd624771528b",
